arnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/qnity-q-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q1","e":"q","d":"2026-05-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jon Kemp","x":"And second, AI-led infrastructure growth is more than offsetting any softness in consumer electronics, whether chips are going to data centers, satellites, or smartphones, we're well positioned to pick up that demand given the depth and breadth of our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/qnity-q-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q1","e":"q","d":"2026-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Goss","x":"Based on what we see today, we don't expect any near-term operational disruption, where we are seeing incremental increases in input or logistics costs, we're taking targeted pricing actions to pass those through in a disciplined manner.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/qnity-q-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q1","e":"q","d":"2026-05-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Goss","x":"With this in mind, we're raising our full year guidance to reflect the strength we realized in the first quarter and our forecast for the remainder of 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/qnity-q-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q2","e":"q","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jon Kemp","x":"Finally, on the back end, our thermal materials move heat across demanding full-system workloads like data centers and other AI applications.","url":"https://ir.qnityelectronics.com/_assets/_ef0c283be843a3b9e84f1358f5178828/qnityelectronics/db/938/9555/webcast_transcript/Qnity+Electronics%2C+Inc.+Second+Quarter+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q2","e":"q","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Goss","x":"These actions are expected to deliver approximately 10% logistics cost savings while improving warehouse efficiency and operating leverage over time.","url":"https://ir.qnityelectronics.com/_assets/_ef0c283be843a3b9e84f1358f5178828/qnityelectronics/db/938/9555/webcast_transcript/Qnity+Electronics%2C+Inc.+Second+Quarter+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q2","e":"q","d":"2026-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Goss","x":"With our strong first half momentum and improved visibility into the second half, we're raising our full-year outlook: Net Sales is now expected to be $5.55B to $5.65B.","url":"https://ir.qnityelectronics.com/_assets/_ef0c283be843a3b9e84f1358f5178828/qnityelectronics/db/938/9555/webcast_transcript/Qnity+Electronics%2C+Inc.+Second+Quarter+2026+Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q3","e":"q","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jon Kemp","x":"Thermal management, advanced packaging and AI printed circuit boards remain the segment's fastest-growing platforms driven by AI tailwinds and rising data center demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/qnity-electronics-q-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q3","e":"q","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jon Kemp","x":"Our expansive portfolio manages heat at every level from the chip and memory components to the board and broader system, giving us more opportunities to help customers optimize system efficiency and maximize AI compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/qnity-electronics-q-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"Q 2026 Q3","e":"q","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ken Rizvi","x":"Building on our strong year-to-date results, we're raising our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/qnity-electronics-q-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,3095,0,0,0,3060,0],[65,1,7705,0,0,0,6621,865],[66,1,2892,0,0,0,2854,0],[67,1,8446,0,0,0,6986,1179]],"cinema":[[64,1,3095,0,0,0,3060,0],[65,1,7705,0,0,0,6621,865],[